{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026skJUPdkA2T1795189467.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>維他奶表示，本港經濟向好，有利業務平穩增長。但內地業務競爭激烈，暫無意減價。</p><p></p><p>維他奶行政總裁陸博濤表示：「面對價格、競爭、促銷活動，以及油價及其波動等因素，我們會盡我們所能去應對。不過，下半年情況可能較上半年更具挑戰，我們評估目前沒有減價的必要，以豆製品類別為例，無論是與其他直接競爭對手相比，還是相較於乳製品，我們的定價都相當穩固且穩定。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.387407+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:02:56.958120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:43.914767+00:00","content_hash":"348da0907aec2da56d6bc99f93b719d7ede9846d375a72d7b63b8d36ebc64605","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.387407+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}